Implemented and committed v1.4 drag support.

Commit: `7d7d3eb Add draggable watermark preview`

What changed:
- Single-mode preview now has a draggable watermark region with hover/drag cursor affordance and highlight.
- Drag updates existing `offsetX` / `offsetY` live, so the offset fields and existing persistence remain the source of truth.
- Dragging is clamped so the watermark keeps about 20% visible on canvas.
- Tiled mode is unchanged.

